From b07e5133c285f530d1b771e055d58c980f8429fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozgur Guzeldereli <ozgur@guzeldereli.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:04:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] ggml: TQ1_P, 160 trits in 32 bytes (1.6 bpw), no block
 scale

Digit plane n of a block lines up with the n-th Q8_0 / Q8_1 block of 32 activations. CPU vec_dot with Q8_0
(scalar + AVX2), CUDA dequant + mmvq, gguf-py type 44, backend tests at the Q38 shapes.
